      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "たしかめようにも、この地の瘴気は危険じゃ。\r\n困ったのう……",
        "official_en": "I am unable to cross the miasma to uncover its source. Woe is me...",
        "real_en": "I'd like to check, but the miasma here is dangerous. What a predicament..."
      },
