    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon670_Odin_01:Summon670_Odin_01_008:06faac11",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Summon670_Odin_01",
        "key": "Summon670_Odin_01_008",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon670_Odin_01:Summon670_Odin_01_008:06faac11",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon670_Odin_01:Summon670_Odin_01_008:06faac11",
        "jp_sha256": "0e5836a60f2f234064b21ad4bcc76604b2ad4217d635e7dc9d135ca43f9b142b",
        "official_en_sha256": "afdc2eeb2952e25bf4401f3d0415960bf56b649e9ed48d112a96e4d70c1a1167"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "前に話した時は\r\n「今度は西のほうから声が聞こえる……。」\r\nと言っていたが、まさかな……。",
        "official_en": "Last time I spoke with him he was muttering something about the voice coming from the west now... Hope he didn’t try heading there.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
