    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon670_Odin_01:Summon670_Odin_01_006:761a75b9",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Summon670_Odin_01",
        "key": "Summon670_Odin_01_006",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon670_Odin_01:Summon670_Odin_01_006:761a75b9",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon670_Odin_01:Summon670_Odin_01_006:761a75b9",
        "jp_sha256": "9c37eb0ca89771f9e8b2e7d85fbf5d4eb1fed602ce1699c0fccd458e950157df",
        "official_en_sha256": "379cbb94bc964c1db20b0e04f22df85eafdea8d7cd459f270935bf1501b0c264"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "急に「大陸の東に行きたい」なんて\r\n言い出すから、あわてて止めたんだ。\r\n瘴気で危ないからな。",
        "official_en": "Damn near stopped my heart when he spoke about heading to the eastern part of the continent. Had to stop him—the miasma would’ve made that a very short trip.",
        "real_en": "He suddenly said he wanted to go east across the continent, so I stopped him in a hurry. The miasma makes it dangerous."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
