        "official_en_sha256": "fa7608ba07cd5380701df18f6dfbaab4827054cc3ac5d50700121d95efcaad4d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "探し物をしていた爺さまなんだが、\r\nこの間、別れを言いに来たよ。",
        "official_en": "You remember that old man that was looking for something? Well, he came to say goodbye. Said he needed to go visit a place.",
        "real_en": "That old man who was looking for something came by to say goodbye the other day."
      },
